{"id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-struc.md","title":"结构集合 STRUC[τ]","display":"df-struc — 结构集合 STRUC[τ]","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-struc","aliases":["29-df-struc"],"display":"df-struc — 结构集合 STRUC[τ]","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-structure]]"],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-struc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-struc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-struc — 结构集合 STRUC[τ]"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-struc-—-有限结构集合-STRUCτ\">df-struc — 有限结构集合 STRUC[τ]</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau \\in \\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau \\in \\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 均是元语言结构类；载集可为任意非空集合，有限性不使全部载集组成一个集合。下式的类概括是成员谓词的缩写，不是集合存在性断言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau] \\coloneqq \\left\\{\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau] \\middle| \\left|\\,|\\mathfrak{A}|\\,\\right|\\in\\mathbb{N}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau] \\coloneqq \\left\\{\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[\\tau] \\middle| \\left|\\,|\\mathfrak{A}|\\,\\right|\\in\\mathbb{N}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限性只约束每个结构的载集；本条不把全部有限结构强行置于一个集合中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-struc-—-有限结构集合-STRUCτ","text":"df-struc — 有限结构集合 STRUC[τ]","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau \\in \\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ (see [[29-df-vocab]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-4